xtras/f8cca03de5f8ac724d1ab2e0941a8e15.mp4?t=1788789415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ara Seo (CV. SIN NA - RI )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Age : 21</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot; You know… I was just thinking, if I were ever to date someone, maybe being with you wouldn’t have been such a bad idea. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ She was always a cheerful and optimistic girl. Back in your school days, you confessed your feelings to her—but before she could answer, you ran off. Now, by chance, you've met her again, and this time, she seems to be interested in you. How will your relationship with her develop? ]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras/58d647a5a3f13699094c3fc5fa6863e7.avif?t=1788789415\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras_big/58d647a5a3f13699094c3fc5fa6863e7.avif?t=1788789415 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuhwa Shin (CV. SON JEONG - MIN )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Age : 27</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot; If you mess up again, I won’t let it slide this time. So, you better handle it well, alright? I’m counting on you, junior? &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ This older sister is the owner of the cocktail bar where you work. She seems laid-back and even gives off an almost superhuman sense of calm. While you’re struggling with the sisters, she playfully teases you but offers a few sharp words of advice. What kind of relationship will develop between you and the sisters?  ]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras/02a9f025b49494797c32bf63853e14f7.avif?t=1788789415\" width=538 height=170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ ABOUT GAME ]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a simple and easy-to-play visual novel game. Enjoy a bittersweet and cocktail-like deep story, brought to life with high-quality Korean voice acting by professional voice actors from Korea’s official voice acting associations. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring 12 high-quality event CGs and full voice acting for all the main characters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A narrative that prioritizes emotional depth over complex branching paths.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre - Romance, Drama, Visual Novel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Time - 3~4 hour, if you heard all voice - 6~7 hour</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ MINI GAME ] </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras/35dea7917fb038f08aa88d1b1c9c8347.poster.avif?t=1788789415\" width=766 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras/35dea7917fb038f08aa88d1b1c9c8347.webm?t=1788789415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770470/extras/35dea7917fb038f08aa88d1b1c9c8347.mp4?t=1788789415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">